\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I will sing the wondrous story
\par Of the Christ who died for me;
\par How He left His home in glory,
\par For the Cross on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes, I'll sing the wondrous story
\par Of the Christ who died for me-
\par Sing it with the saints in glory.
\par Gathered by the crystal sea.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I was lost; but Jesus  found me-
\par Found the sheep that went astray;
\par Raised me up and gently led me
\par Back into the narrow way.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes, I'll sing the wondrous story
\par Of the Christ who died for me-
\par Sing it with the saints in glory.
\par Gathered by the crystal sea.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I was bruised; but Jesus healed me:
\par Faint was I from many a fall;
\par Sight was gone, and fears possessed me:
\par But He freed me from them all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes, I'll sing the wondrous story
\par Of the Christ who died for me-
\par Sing it with the saints in glory.
\par Gathered by the crystal sea.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Days of darkness still come o'er me;
\par Sorrow's paths I often tread:
\par But the Saviour still is with me,
\par But His hand I'm safely led.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes, I'll sing the wondrous story
\par Of the Christ who died for me-
\par Sing it with the saints in glory.
\par Gathered by the crystal sea.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. He will keep me till the river
\par Rolls its waters at my feet,
\par Then He'll bear me safely over,
\par Where  the loved ones I shall meet.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes, I'll sing the wondrous story
\par Of the Christ who died for me-
\par Sing it with the saints in glory.
\par Gathered by the crystal sea.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
